<title>UK: ZCCM reports rockfall accident at Mufulira.</title>
<headline>ZCCM reports rockfall accident at Mufulira.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia Copper Investments Ltd (ZCCM) said on Thursday that there had been a rockfall accident at the Mufulira Division underground mine.</p>
<p>However, there has been no interruption of other mining operations, which continue as normal.</p>
<p>In a release, ZCCM said two workmen were fatally injured, while five other workers were less-seriously injured.</p>
<p>&quot;The rockfall accident, which happened...on July 1...was as a result of a seismic event which happened without any prior warning,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--London newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
